{"explanation": "Responds to small ornate decorative accents on accessories, especially jewelry-like metalwork: gold or silver pieces with rhinestones or gems, bows, ribbons and flower-shaped ornaments, and dangling chains or cords. Activity is highest when one such ornamented object is shown clearly and close up, and lower in cluttered scenes or on plain, unornamented items. Compared with similar units, it prefers sparkling metallic or jeweled floral and bow ornaments (brooch, buckle, necklace, hair bow) over embroidered or knitted pattern textures (skull loafer, knitted mitten) and printed graphics (binder).", "predictions": [{"question": "Does the main object have shiny metallic or jeweled decoration (gold or silver metal, rhinestones, gems, metal clasps)?", "answers": ["Yes, prominent sparkling metal or jewels", "Only small or plain metal parts", "No metal or jewel decoration"], "most_active": "Yes, prominent sparkling metal or jewels", "least_active": "No metal or jewel decoration"}, {"question": "Does the object have a bow, ribbon, or flower-shaped ornament on it?", "answers": ["Yes, a clear bow, ribbon or flower ornament", "No such ornament"], "most_active": "Yes, a clear bow, ribbon or flower ornament", "least_active": "No such ornament"}, {"question": "Is the object shown alone and close up against a plain background, or among many items in a cluttered scene?", "answers": ["Single object, close up, plain background", "Single object in a busy setting", "Many items or a cluttered scene"], "most_active": "Single object, close up, plain background", "least_active": "Many items or a cluttered scene"}, {"question": "What kind of decoration covers the object's surface?", "answers": ["Separate attached ornaments such as charms, jewels, bows or hanging chains", "Knitted, woven or embroidered pattern", "Printed graphics or text", "Plain, no decoration"], "most_active": "Separate attached ornaments such as charms, jewels, bows or hanging chains", "least_active": "Plain, no decoration"}]}
```

